    <title>慌啥子嘛，慢慢来，太阳下山有月亮爬上来</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6b02be0d6f7bbb70cd592d91</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6b02be0d6f7bbb70cd592d91</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 10:21:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>嗨，我的好朋友们，&nbsp;和你们聊聊最近我觉得挺荒唐的一件事。有人用&nbsp;AI 合成了赵本山的声线，替他唱火了一首歌。老爷子知道以后，没发律师函，自己买下了版权进录音棚真唱了一遍。录到一半，他停下来问工作人员：是不是跟 AI 不像？</span></p><p><span>今天我们不聊&nbsp;AI，也不拆这首歌为什么火。就聊一句「别慌」，凭什么从赵本山的嘴巴里说出来，我们才肯信。</span></p><p><span>🎧 背景音乐</span></p><p><span>William ZZ - Cat like</span></p><p><span>William ZZ - A Night in Bali</span></p><p><span>🎵歌曲列表&amp;⏱️时间轴：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> -赵本山 - 慌啥子嘛</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="325">05:25</a> -赵本山,赵大牛,球球 - 慌啥子嘛</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="545">09:05</a> -村口吴老二 - 慌啥子嘛</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a>-小何 - 不要慌不要慌 （太阳下山有月光）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1000">16:40</a> -王宇宙Leto,乔浚丞 - 若月亮没来</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1220">20:20</a>-赵本山 - 慌啥子嘛</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkLjNg1j-KUr3RZ9UuIcK15uuWT5.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FofaNVA8Bz74sUdfuvb0dBxeHVfy.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgQC-AWN0Zao2QNPOq2ULWxtv4-o.JPG"><p><span>💫选题策划、声音剪辑制作、主播：方方</span></p><p><span>📮节目介绍</span></p><p><span>「上房揭瓦 sound music」是一档音乐分享类的播客节目，致力于给大家分享一些好听的音乐。欢迎评论区小板凳入座~</span></p><p><span>👂收听平台</span></p><p><span>小宇宙 |</span><a href="https://163cn.tv/3bGsyg8" data-url="https://163cn.tv/3bGsyg8"><span> 网易云音乐 |</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://www.douban.com/doubanapp/dispatch?uri=/podcast/36935732/&amp;dt_dapp=1" data-url="https://www.douban.com/doubanapp/dispatch?uri=/podcast/36935732/&amp;dt_dapp=1"><span>豆瓣</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/6765086910" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/6765086910"><span>微博</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/%E4%B8%8A%E6%88%BF%E6%8F%AD%E7%93%A6-sound-music/id1649191098" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/%E4%B8%8A%E6%88%BF%E6%8F%AD%E7%93%A6-sound-music/id1649191098"><span>苹果播客</span></a><s