  <item>
    <title>陶喆：这世界有点假，但我莫名爱上它</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6afa57d0fe62f8f52c4bb46d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6afa57d0fe62f8f52c4bb46d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 01:13:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>陶喆在《黑色柳丁》里写过一句歌词：</span></p><p><span>"这世界有点假，但我莫名爱上它。"</span></p><p><span>这句词放在今天看，几乎是他整个人生的注脚。</span></p><p><span>家世显赫却去美国卖鞋当文职；才华封神却常年现场翻车；站上过最高领奖台，也跌进过最泥的舆论坑；被全网做成表情包，最后又是靠作品让所有人收起笑声。</span></p><p><span>他不是完美的偶像，从不需要人设。</span></p><p><span>他只是恰好活成了华语乐坛最罕见的那种人：有真本事，敢真翻车，摔得真惨，站得真稳。</span></p><p><span>所以年轻人爱他，从来不是因为梗好笑——</span></p><p><span>是因为在一堆精致又虚假的东西里，他们终于认出了一个真实的人。</span></p><p><span>爱很简单。他三十年前就唱给我们了。</span></p><p><span>🎧 背景音乐</span></p><p><span>Kris Bowers - Love is A Choice</span></p><p><span>Ludovico Einaudi - Una Mattina</span></p><p><span>Vitamin String Quartet - Girls Like You</span></p><p><span>🎵歌曲列表&amp;⏱️时间轴：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a> -就是爱你</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="447">07:27</a> 望春风</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="622">10:22</a> -爱,很简单</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="975">16:15</a> -找自己</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1275">21:15</a> -黑色柳丁</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1610">26:50</a> -爱我还是他</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1985">33:05</a> -天天</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2305">38:25</a> -小镇姑娘</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2655">44:15</a> -二十二</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkSt6xb-86NxARa272Y03GUdX0FB.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs-vXOglxdoRcNbkMISMgziscFOH.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpSw64uJ8BTaiCeqnHtrcRGc_aQ-.jpg"><p><span>💫选题策划、声音剪辑制作、主播：方方</span></p><p><span>📮节目介绍</span></p><p><span>「上房揭瓦 sound music」是一档音乐分享类的播客节目，致力于给大家分享一些好听的音乐。欢迎评论区小板凳入座~</span></p><p><span>👂收听平台</span></p><p><span>小宇宙 | </span><a href="https://163cn.tv/3bGsyg8" data-url="https://163cn.tv/3bGsyg8"><span>网易云音乐</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://www.douban.com/doubanapp/dispatch?uri=/podcast/36935732/&amp;dt_dapp=1" data-url="https://www.douban.com/doubanapp/dispatch?uri=/podcast/36935732/&amp;dt_dapp=1"><span>豆瓣</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/6765086910" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/6765086910"><span>微博</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/%E4%B8%8A%E6%88%BF%E6%8F%AD%E7%93%A6-sound-music/id1649191098" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/%E4%B8%8A%E6%88%BF%E6%8F%AD%E7%93%A6-sound-music/id1649191098"><span>苹果播客</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://xima.tv/1_3dUOQp?_sonic=0" data-url="https://xima.tv/1_3dUOQp?_sonic=0"><span>喜马拉雅</span></a></p><p><span>🙌关注我们</span></p><p><span>🌟公众号：野生小圆的精神世界</span></p><p><span>📍商务、媒体合作：添加微信：yeshengxiaoyuan08，请备注来意</span></p><p><span>🔗欢迎分享</span></p><p><span>如果你喜欢这期节目，欢迎分享给你的好朋友呀~</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
